folio website created to establish the agency’s online presence and showcase its brand identity, creative capabilities, and services. Developed with React.js, the website focuses on presenting the agency professionally through a modern interface, structured content, reusable components, and responsive layouts optimized for different devices.","conclusion":"Delivered a modern agency portfolio website that communicates Revo Advertising’s identity and presents its creative work and services through a responsive React experience.","thumbnail":{"src":"/images/revo/revo lab.png","alt":"Revo Advertising project thumbnail"},"heroImage":{"src":"/images/revo/revo thumbnail.jpeg","alt":"Revo Advertising project hero preview"},"coverImage":{"src":"/images/revo/revo4.jpeg","alt":"Revo Advertising project showcase"},"images":[{"src":"/images/revo/revo.jpeg","alt":"Revo Advertising project showcase image 1"},{"src":"/images/revo/revoo.jpeg","alt":"Revo Advertising project showcase image 2"}],"services":["Agency Portfolio Development","React.js Development","Frontend Architecture","Creative Work Presentation","Responsive Web Design","UI/UX Implementation"],"serviceSlugs":["web-application-development"],"client":"Revo Advertising","website":"https://revo.com","tags":["React.js","JavaScript","Agency Portfolio","Web Development","Responsive Design","UI/UX"],"link":"https://github.com/oelbouha/Revo","quote":"A professional digital portfolio designed to communicate an advertising agency’s identity, showcase its work, and present its services.","quoteAuthor":"Project Highlights","quoteRole":"Frontend Development"},"nextProject":{"slug":"pong-arena","title":"Pong Arena","category":"Full Stack Web App","year":"2024","tagline":"Real-time multiplayer gaming built for the web.","description":"A full-stack multiplayer gaming platform built with Django and JavaScript, featuring real-time gameplay, WebSockets, and tournament management.","overview":"Pong Arena is a full-stack multiplayer web app